--- !u!114 &1582818630604724540
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5079878026147091509}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5b72b968ab35b7747863b866328637d6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizManagerArun
  questions:
  - questionText: 1,What happened when the magician challeneged the audience to perform
      magic?
    option1: The assembly became silent.
    option2: Everyone pretended to be zombies.
    option3: People ran away.
    option4: The audience asked the King to perform the same magic.
    option1IsCorrect: 1
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 83cc35b542702b24bb0f5450049fd7ff, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 0a465700af60edf4893ddfa333a21180, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: "2,What was King Krishnadevaraya\u2019s reaction to seeing no response
      from the audience ?"
    option1: He was confused.
    option2: He was terrified.
    option3: He was disappointed.
    option4: He was shocked.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 1
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47ac659ad62270c4fb4e3bda673a1027, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 5d8e0dd88705c7d41a27dcf1762a4ad7, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 3
  - questionText: 3,Who came forward and challenged the magician ?
    option1: Rajinikanth
    option2: Tom Cruise
    option3: Shivaji Maharaj
    option4: Tenali Raman
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 1
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40dba1b9934df424f975065f915e5868, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 6822309d3be92a34993c3b8b00c71019, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: 4,Raman bought a bag full of __________?
    option1: Tumeric powder.
    option2: Baking powder.
    option3: Red chilli powder
    option4: Cocoa powder.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 1
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e87309b1d7e748c408821c46e87c8e27, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 0a1103e67f3dd6f4ca5dee39738a262c, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 3
  - questionText: 5,After applying and removing the powder from his eye-lids, what
      did Tenali Raman say to the magician ?
    option1: Ask someone in the audience to perform the trick.
    option2: Perform this trick with your eyes open.
    option3: Perform the same trick with your mouth wide open.
    option4: Perform the same trick with green chilli paste.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 14f18f1f20553a648a81a575b088aa91, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 2d05ce74432f1e143bfda496e8c5f155, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: 6,What did King Krishnadevaraya offer to Tenali Raman after he
      defeated magician ?
    option1: A job as his charioteer.
    option2: A job as a drum player in a durbar.
    option3: A place as a jester in his durbar.
    option4: A place
